    "description": "<p>The Abyssal's Essence is a conduit for the hunger of Oblivion. Each time the Abyssal deals damage with an Archery attack against a living, sentient being — not undead, automaton, or demon — she regains one mote per health level of damage inflicted. No more than 20 motes may be recovered from this Charm in a single action, regardless of the number of Ravening Mouth effects active. Motes from spells are not recovered, nor are motes triggered by ongoing damage such as poisons or similar effects applied in an earlier action.</p>",
